{"id":"8cfeb2a9ac08907d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-mlrandom-martingale.md","title":"有效上鞅刻画 Martin-Löf 随机性","display":"thm-mlrandom-martingale — 有效上鞅刻画 Martin-Löf 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-mlrandom-martingale","aliases":["43-thm-mlrandom-martingale"],"display":"thm-mlrandom-martingale — 有效上鞅刻画 Martin-Löf 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-effective-martingale]]","[[43-df-covers]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.5，印刷207，PDF227","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-mlrandom-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-mlrandom-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mlrandom-martingale — 有效上鞅刻画 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.5，印刷207，PDF227"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；相关谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}\">\\(\\mathrm{Covers}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\">\\((2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca2fbe2bdf667589\" href=\"?note=ca2fbe2bdf667589\" title=\"43-df-effective-martingale\">43-df-effective-martingale</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveSupermartingale}(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>资本阈值采用严格不等式以保证有效开性，再用最大不等式控制测度。反向将检验各层的条件测度加总成有效鞅。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.5，印刷207，PDF227。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-covers]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；相关谓词见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；相关谓词见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-martingale]]、[[43-df-covers]]。","embed":fa